---
import Layout from "@layouts/ComponentsLayout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Components</h1>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    This is a collection of components that have been used across i.AI that can
    be used to avoid having to design bespoke components for each project.
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    It has been built using the <a
      href="https://design-system.service.gov.uk/components/"
      class="govuk-link">GOV.UK Design System</a
    > as a starting point. Only when the initial design didn't meet the needs of an
    app we have built have we adapted them or added new ones.
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">
    Every decision about when components have diverged from GOV.UK has been
    documented in the <a href="/principles" class="govuk-link"
      >principles section</a
    > or can be found in each component's documentation.
  </p>
  <p class="govuk-body">Maybe some key here about the tabs we want to add?</p>
</Layout>
